***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** OS & Editor Junk
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.tmp

***REMOVED*** VS Code / IDE configs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Python - global patterns (apps should still have their own .gitignore)
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

***REMOVED*** Byte-compiled and cache artifacts
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
pip-wheel-metadata/
*.log

***REMOVED*** Hatch/Pipenv/Poetry caches (if used globally)
.hatch/
.venv/
.env/        ***REMOVED*** in case a global .env exists at root

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SECURITY: Environment Files - ALL variants
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Exclude ALL .env files except example templates
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

***REMOVED*** Production and sensitive configurations
**/production.yml
**/prod.yml
**/.env.prod
**/.env.production
**/.env.observability.*
**/.env.monitoring.*

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Node.js (for frontend apps or tools)
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
dist/
.next/
out/

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Coverage & Test Reports
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage
**/.coverage
.coverage.*
**/.coverage.*
coverage.xml
**/coverage.xml
.tox/
.nox/
*.cover
*.py,cover
.cache
pytest_cache/
junit*.xml

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Monorepo tooling
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.lock           ***REMOVED*** e.g., if using pip-tools or pnpm
.lock-wip
turbo/

model_cache

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Local Development Storage
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SECURITY: Database Files
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SECURITY: Keys and Certificates
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
*.pub

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SECURITY: AWS and Cloud Credentials
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.aws/
**/credentials
**/config
**/.boto
**/.s3cfg
